# Pairs with CaptureEventuallyLinked. The liveness face of #4914: the timeout ends the cycle but the split stays unlinked.
MODULE: SetParentQueuedNeverLinks
TARGET: CaptureEventuallyLinked
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: SetParentAsync queues behind the capture turn, so the split is never linked
PERTURBS: AdmitSetParent

--- FIND
    /\ seed' = IF SetParentInterleaves \/ leafTurn # "capture" THEN "admitted" ELSE "blocked"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: SetParentAsync is not [AlwaysInterleave]
    /\ seed' = IF FALSE THEN "admitted" ELSE "blocked"
--- END
